#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI, toupatou"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "Yon sèl modèl tòken rezoud, refòme an fichye stil, lyen pou kad (framework), kòd natif, ak chaj pou zouti konsepsyon."

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kòmanse"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "Kat pakè a"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Referans API"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Referans CSS"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Yon sèl sous laverite"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Chak pakè li menm IR tòken rezoud la. Chanje yon tòken anwo, epi li pral rive nan CSS, SCSS, kòd natif, ak Figma menm jan an."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Sèvi ak pi piti pakè a"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Enstale sèlman @pantoken/css pou yon fichye stil, @pantoken/react pou hooks ak ikon, oswa yon preset bundler pou Tailwind, Panda, oswa MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Jenere pou nenpòt platfòm"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Egzekite `pantoken generate` pou pwodui Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, ak plis ankò. Menm tòken yo, nan idyòm chak ekosistèm."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Pa gen kouplaj ak sous anlè"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Tòken yo anbake kòm JSON estatik, kidonk `npm i` pa janm depann sou yon sous ki sèlman sou GitHub. Piblikab, semver, epi zanmitay offline."
